  "2026-07-26T12:47:23.836Z","harness:codex","Partial implementation evidence: validate lifecycle now builds one hierarchy graph from scalar parents plus every registry-declared hierarchy dependency spelling, including source_parent/target_parent directions, missing targets, aliases, dedupe, and closed holders; child_of cycles are now reported. Mutation fail-fast, graph/health agreement, legacy classification, and merge-conformance clauses remain outstanding, so this item remains incomplete."
